        "en": {
          "plain": "This card cannot be nullified.\n[Cn/Turn] Choose and use one of the following two.\n• [Counter] For this turn, the next damage you take by an attack becomes 0, and the next damage you take by your opponent's card effects becomes 0.\n• Draw a card. Then, put the top card of your deck into your gauge and you gain 1 life for each card on your field.",
